<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="750" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Ciutadella regular&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody><tr><td style="line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="680" style="text-align: center;"><tbody><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tbody><tr width="680"><td align="center" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: center; height: 60px; width: 680px;"><div style="height: 15px; line-height: 15px;">&nbsp;</div><div style="line-height: 15px; height: 15px; width: 680px;">Don't miss the chance to save up to 15% on business travel.</div><div style="height: 15px; line-height: 15px;">&nbsp;</div><div style="height: 15px; line-height: 15px;">&nbsp;</div></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 680px;"><tbody><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tbody><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><a href="http://www.qantas.com/" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;"><img alt="Qantas" border="0" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2031794577/QBR+email+header.jpg" title="Qantas" width="680" style="display: block; width: 680px; height: 70px;"></a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table><table id="main-content" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="680" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;"><tbody><tr><td valign="top" align="center" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: left;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600"><tbody><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" class="h2" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 22px; color: rgb(22, 22, 22); line-height: 26px;">Up to 15% off the base fare of eligible Qantas flights</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><a href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/offer/PARTNER-AIRLINE-POINTS-EARN" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;"><img border="0" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2031739727/190923+QANTAS+Ancil+1_3052+680x359.jpg" title="Save up to 15% off the base fare of eligible Qantas flights" alt="Save up to 15% off the base fare of eligible Qantas flights" width="600"></a></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;">Hi {!Contact.FirstName},</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;">Further to our conversation, for a limited time, your business travellers are able to save up to 15% on the base fare (excluding taxes, fees and surcharges) of eligible Qantas international and domestic flights.*</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;">To take advantage of this offer, log in and book via your Qantas Business Rewards account or with your preferred Travel Agent between by 29 September, for travel between 1 October and 15 December 2019.</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;">Don't forget to add your business' ABN and the traveller's Qantas Frequent Flyer membership number when you book. That way, you'll earn Qantas Points twice on every Eligible Flight – once for your business^ and once for the traveller.<sup class="salesforce_curl" style="font-size: small; line-height: 0px;">~</sup></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" align="left" class="w100perc" style="margin: 0px auto;"><tbody><tr><td width="6" align="right" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 0px; width: 6px; border: 0px;"><a href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/tools/book-flights" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"><img src="http://loyalty.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/3001543098/qa_primary_cta_l.png" width="6" height="40" border="0" alt="" title="" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block;"></a></td><td height="40" bgcolor="#E40000" align="center" valign="middle" class="w100perc applelinkwhite" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 16px; height: 40px; vertical-align: middle; padding: 0px 10px; border: 0px;"><a class="ten" href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/tools/book-flights" target="_blank" alt="Book now" title="Book now" style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; line-height: 16px; font-family: Ciutadella, Arial, Helvetica !important; text-decoration-line: none !important;">Book now</a></td><td width="6" align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 0px; width: 6px; border: 0px;"><a href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/tools/book-flights" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;"><img src="http://loyalty.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/3001543099/qa_primary_cta_r.png" width="6" height="40" border="0" alt="" title="" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block;"></a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;">&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 680px;"><tbody><tr><td align="center" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" style="font-size: 10px; margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 15px; margin: 0px;"></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 10px; height: 10px; margin: 0px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 23px; margin: 0px; height: 23px;"><h3 style="font-size: 18px; color: rgb(22, 22, 22); line-height: 22px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px;">Important information</h3></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" bgcolor="#F4F5F6" width="600" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 15px; height: 15px; margin: 0px; width: 600px;"><br></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 680px;"><tbody><tr><td align="center" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" style="margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); line-height: 13px; height: 13px;">* Qantas Business Rewards members must (a) book an Eligible Flight between 12.01am AEST 23 September 2019 and 11.59pm AEST 29 September 2019 for travel departing and completed between 1 October and 15 December 2019 (b) book travel via Qantas Business Rewards, an IATA or TIDs registered Travel Agency or ticketed via an approved Ticketing Consolidator. Discounts available exclusively to Qantas Business Rewards members on eligible domestic Red e-Deal, Economy Flex, and Business fares and international Economy Saver, Economy Flex, Premium Economy Sale, Premium Economy, Business Sale and Business fares only and do not apply to taxes, fees and carrier charges. Availability is limited. Other conditions apply. Travel Agents or customers on a Corporate Deal with Qantas are not eligible for this offer. See full&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/terms#definationAirline" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">terms and conditions</a>. Offer ends 11.59pm AEST 29 September 2019 unless sold out prior. Not to be used in conjunction with any other offer.</td></tr><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); line-height: 13px; height: 13px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); line-height: 13px; height: 13px;">^ Qantas Points for business are offered under&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/terms#airlineterms" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">Qantas' Terms and Conditions</a>&nbsp;and earning thresholds apply. Qantas Points earned from air travel are determined in accordance with the&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/offer/airlineearntable" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">Airline Earn Table</a>. A member's ABN and traveller's Qantas Frequent Flyer membership number must be quoted at the time of booking to earn Qantas Points for both the business and the traveller. An Eligible Flight means a domestic or international flight which has a Qantas 'QF' flight number on the ticket that is purchased in Australia and is booked and travelled for business on or after the date the business registers for Qantas Business Rewards.&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/terms#definationAirline" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">Exclusions apply</a>.</td></tr><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); line-height: 13px; height: 13px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); line-height: 13px; height: 13px;">~ Your customer must be a Qantas Frequent Flyer member to earn Qantas Points. A joining fee may apply. Membership and Qantas Points are subject to the&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/fflyer/dyn/program/terms" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">Qantas Frequent Flyer program Terms and Conditions</a>. Qantas Points and Status Credits (where applicable) are earned on&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/fflyer/dyn/program/terms#eligibleflights" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">Eligible Flights</a>&nbsp;with a Qantas or applicable&nbsp;<b>one</b>world® Alliance Airline or Airline Partner flight number on your ticket. Qantas Points and Status Credits may not be earned on some fare types and booking classes. See&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/fflyer/dyn/program/terms#eligibleflights" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">terms and conditions</a>&nbsp;and the&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/fflyer/dyn/flying/airline-earning" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">Airline Earning Tables</a>&nbsp;for details on the conditions for the applicable airline.</td></tr><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); line-height: 13px; height: 13px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); line-height: 13px; height: 13px;">To unsubscribe from these offers, reply to this email with the subject line 'Unsubscribe'.</td></tr><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); line-height: 13px; height: 13px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>]]></td>
</tr>
